---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
---

<section class="relative isolate flex min-h-[calc(100vh-4rem)] items-center overflow-hidden">
	<div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10">
		<Image
			src="/backdrop.webp"
			alt="Alpha Running Shoes"
			class="w-full h-full object-cover"
			width={2070}
			height={1380}
			decoding="async"
			fetchpriority="high"
		/>
		<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-r from-slate-900/95 via-slate-900/80 to-slate-900/50"></div>
	</div>

	<div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-20">
		<div class="max-w-2xl">
			<p class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-green-500">Santa Rosa de Copán</p>
			<h1 class="text-4xl font-black tracking-tighter text-white sm:text-6xl">
				Corre con la manada. <span class="text-green-500">Entrena con ciencia.</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-6 text-lg text-zinc-300">
				Somos Alpha Running Club, los Mustangs de Copán. Comunidad, rutas analizadas y herramientas para que cada kilómetro cuente.
			</p>
			<div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
				{/* CTA "Únete a la manada" desactivado temporalmente
				<a
					href={SOCIAL_LINKS.instagram}
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					class="rounded-full bg-green-500 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-black transition-colors hover:bg-green-400"
				>
					Únete a la manada
				</a>
				*/}
				<a
					href="/zonas-desempeno"
					class="rounded-full bg-green-500 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-black transition-colors hover:bg-green-400"
				>
					Calcula tus zonas
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
